    "display_name": "Check the Menu",
    "long_instructions": "After your chatbot greets you, you’d like for it to tell you what your school’s cafeteria is serving for lunch and when lunch will be. For example, it might say “Good morning! The cafeteria is serving burritos in 4 hours.”\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n1. Define a string variable that stores a meal’s name.\r\n2. Define an integer variable that stores a number of hours.\r\n3. Print a message that says hello to the user and uses your two variables to tell the user when lunch is and what will be served.\r\n",
